This is Version 1.1 of the license first published as Version 1.0 (2026). The
ten Sephirotic Articles are unchanged in substance: perpetual open access,
network reciprocity, no monetization, the behavioural prohibitions, the
directivity cap, viral share-alike, non-reduction, memory-boundary integrity,
and the disclaimer. Version 1.1 adds the definitions, the patent grant, the
attribution mechanics, the cure period and the general terms that Version 1.0
left out, so that the ten Articles say in law what they already said in intent.

NOTE ON STATUS, STATED PLAINLY: this license restricts commercial use and
certain fields of use. Those restrictions are deliberate and are the point of
it. They also mean this license is not an "open source" license as the Open
Source Initiative defines that term, and not "free software" as the Free
Software Foundation defines it. The honest description of a work under this
license is "source available" or "ethical source", freely usable for every
non-commercial purpose. This license has not been reviewed by a lawyer.

