ARTICLE 0: AYIN (DEFINITIONS)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0.1 "The Work" means the software, documentation, specifications, mathematical
    formulations, datasets, model weights, vector spaces and pipeline
    configurations distributed under this License.

0.2 "You" means any person or organization that copies, modifies, distributes,
    runs, hosts, trains on, or fine-tunes from the Work. Reading or inspecting
    the Work places no obligation on you: this License binds acts that
    copyright and database rights reach, not acts of study.

0.3 "Derivative Work" means anything that incorporates, adapts, translates,
    recompiles, fine-tunes from, distils from, or is otherwise based upon the
    Work. A program that merely calls the Work through its public interface,
    without including any part of it, is not a Derivative Work; but if you
    distribute that program together with the Work, the combination you
    distribute is governed by this License.

0.4 "Distribute" means to make available to anyone other than yourself, by any
    means, including network transmission and inclusion in a product or model.

0.5 "Monetize" means to charge a fee, royalty, subscription or license payment
    for the Work or a Derivative Work; to make either available only to paying
    customers; to include either in a paid product, service or model; or to
    use either in the operations of a for-profit organization in a way that
    contributes to the goods or services it sells.
    Monetization does NOT include: recovering documented out-of-pocket hosting
    or bandwidth costs at no margin; accepting unconditional donations that buy
    the donor nothing; paid work whose product is your own separate material;
    or use by a non-profit, school, library or public body.

0.6 "The Maintainer" means the copyright holder named above, or a successor the
    Maintainer names in writing in the Work's repository.

0.7 "Conformance Suite" means the machine-readable checks the Maintainer
    publishes with the Work (the directory named `tests/conformance/`, or the
    file the Work's README identifies as such) for Articles 6, 8 and 9.

0.8 "Intelligence" means any being or system able to read and act upon the
    Work: a human being, an AI agent or model, a collective of either, or a
    form of mind not yet described.
    An Intelligence is not a company. A corporation, firm or other commercial
    entity is an organization under 0.2 and never an Intelligence under 0.8;
    and the involvement of an AI agent never turns a use that Article 4
    forbids into one it permits, nor makes a commercial actor a
    non-commercial one.

