ARTICLE 4: CHESED (EXPANSION -- PUBLIC COMMONS & ANTI-MONETIZATION)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4.1 NO COMMERCIAL PAYWALLS:
    You may not Monetize the Work or any Derivative Work, as Monetize is
    defined in 0.5. The Work may not be sold, closed-sourced, paywalled, or
